A: How do you say how often you do something in Russian? You (@draw o_park k0@) can already say я хожу́ в парк ка́ждый день.
    draw tom tom_name

A: Today: always, never, and the words in between.
    highlight k0 color #5b8c5a effect underline part "ка́ждый день"

    erase o_park k0

    hide tom tom_name

A: Picture ten chances to go somewhere. Всегда́, always: all ten.
    draw ten f1

B: Я всегда́ е́зжу на рабо́ту на метро́.
    draw e1

    erase e1

A: Ча́сто is often: most of them. Я ча́сто хожу́ в кино́.
    draw f2 e2

    erase e2

B: Иногда́, sometimes: a few. Иногда́ я е́зжу к ба́бушке.
    draw f3 e3

    erase e3

A: Ре́дко, rarely: not often. Я ре́дко хожу́ в теа́тр.
    draw f4 e4

    erase e4

A: And no dots at all: никогда́, never.
    draw f5

B: Я никогда́ не хожу́ в теа́тр.
    draw e5

A: Listen for the не. With никогда́, Russian says not as well: never, not.
    highlight f5_w e5 color #8a5fa8 part ^не$

B: In English that's a double negative; in Russian it's the rule, and leaving out не is the mistake.
    highlight e5 color #8a5fa8 part ^не$ effect underline

    quiz "Which word needs не before the verb?" voice a
        right: Никогда́: я никогда́ не хожу́.
        wrong: Only one of them means never.
        * всегда́
        * иногда́
        + никогда́

    erase e5

A: Where do they go? Mostly just (@highlight e7 color #5b8c5a effect underline part ча́сто@) before the verb, or first: (@highlight e8 color #5b8c5a effect underline part ^Иногда́@) я ча́сто хожу́, иногда́ я е́зжу; or (@draw e9@) at the end, as an answer: в теа́тр я (@highlight e9 color #5b8c5a effect underline part ре́дко@) хожу́ ре́дко.
    draw e7 e8

    erase e7 e8 e9

B: And the verb is the habit one, (@highlight e6 color #5b8c5a effect underline@) хожу́ or е́зжу, not иду́, as with ка́ждый день in lesson sixty-two.
    draw e6

    erase e6

    erase rows ten

A: To be exact, count the times: раз в неде́лю, once a week.
    draw cal week hit1 n1

B: Неде́ля becomes неде́лю after в, as in че́рез неде́лю, and as суббо́та becomes в суббо́ту.
    highlight n1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part неде́лю

A: Twice is два ра́за, with the а (@highlight n2 color #c9871a part ра́за effect underline@) from три ра́за в день: два ра́за в неде́лю.
    draw hit2 n2

    erase cal week hit1 hit2 n1 n2

A: And looking back, with ра́ньше: Ра́ньше я ча́сто (@draw r_now r_nd parallel true@) ходи́л в кино́, а сейча́с ре́дко.
    draw r1 r2 r_then r_td parallel true

B: I used to go often, but now rarely: ходи́л, (@highlight r1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part ходи́л@) because it was a habit.
    highlight r1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part ^Ра́ньше

    erase r1 r2 r_then r_td r_now r_nd

A: Now Masha. Listen: how often does she go?
    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Ма́ша, ты ча́сто хо́дишь в теа́тр?
    draw bal_t caption false

    erase bal_t

    draw bal_m

    ask "How often does she go to the cinema?" voice b options ["once a week","twice a week","never"] correct 2
        gloss: I rarely go to the theatre, but to the cinema twice a week.
        listen: В теа́тр я хожу́ ре́дко, а в кино́ два ра́за в неде́лю.
        right: Twice a week: два ра́за в неде́лю.
        wrong: Ре́дко was the theatre; listen for the number before в неде́лю.

    erase bal_m

A: Now the whole conversation. Listen, then practise it.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw q_cin

    quiz "Ра́ньше я ча́сто ходи́л в кино́. What does it mean?" say_answer false reveal.text "used to go often" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: I used to go often: ра́ньше and the past ходи́л.
        wrong: Ра́ньше looks back.
        * I often go to the cinema.
        + I used to go to the cinema often.
        * I will often go to the cinema.

    erase q_cin

    draw q_bars

    quiz "Which one means the most times?" reveal.text ча́сто reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Ча́сто is often; иногда́ is sometimes, and ре́дко is rarely.
        wrong: One of them means often.
        + ча́сто
        * ре́дко
        * иногда́

    erase q_bars

    draw q_cal

    quiz "Twice a week?" reveal.text "два ра́за в неде́лю" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Два ра́за, with the а after два, and в неде́лю, like в суббо́ту.
        wrong: Two things: the а after два, and неде́лю after в.
        * два раз в неде́лю
        * два ра́за в неде́ля
        + два ра́за в неде́лю

    erase q_cal

    draw q_park

    ask "Say that you often go to the park." say_it "Я ча́сто хожу́ в парк." gloss "I often go to the park." voice a show cue test t1

A: Я ча́сто хожу́ в парк.
    draw q_say

    erase q_park q_say

    draw q_no q_cin2

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I never go to the cinema." answer ["я никогда не хожу в кино","никогда не хожу в кино","в кино я никогда не хожу","я в кино никогда не хожу"] reveal.text "Я никогда́ не хожу́ в кино́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я никогда́ не хожу́ в кино́: никогда́, then не, then the habit verb.
        wrong: Never takes не too, and the verb is the habit one.

    erase q_no q_cin2

    group sum members ["s1w","s2w","s3w"]

