A: So how often is one word beside the habit verb, from всегда́ down to ре́дко.
    highlight s1w color #5b8c5a effect underline

B: Never brings its не along; and for the exact count, (@highlight s3w color #5b8c5a effect underline@) два ра́за в неде́лю.
    highlight s2w color #5b8c5a effect underline part ^не$

    erase sum

